": "This output shows that the audit logger"}, {"start_seconds": 587.72, "end_seconds": 591.16, "text": "dependency successfully received the"}, {"start_seconds": 589.52, "end_seconds": 593.16, "text": "request {underscore} ID from its"}, {"start_seconds": 591.16, "end_seconds": 595.2, "text": "sub-dependency get {underscore} request"}, {"start_seconds": 593.16, "end_seconds": 596.76, "text": "{underscore} ID, which defaults to"}, {"start_seconds": 595.2, "end_seconds": 598.56, "text": "unset."}, {"start_seconds": 596.76, "end_seconds": 600.56, "text": "Notice how the key logged {underscore}"}, {"start_seconds": 598.56, "end_seconds": 602.84, "text": "request {underscore} ID reflects this"}, {"start_seconds": 600.56, "end_seconds": 604.76, "text": "default value, demonstrating how nested"}, {"start_seconds": 602.84, "end_seconds": 606.56, "text": "dependencies can pass values through"}, {"start_seconds": 604.76, "end_seconds": 608.32, "text": "layers automatically, an important"}, {"start_seconds": 606.56, "end_seconds": 611.52, "text": "concept for organizing complex"}, {"start_seconds": 608.32, "end_seconds": 613.24, "text": "dependency chains."}, {"start_seconds": 611.52, "end_seconds": 615.32, "text": "Dependency {underscore} overrides"}, {"start_seconds": 613.24, "end_seconds": 617.6, "text": "genuinely works for a real class-based"}, {"start_seconds": 615.32, "end_seconds": 620.08, "text": "dependency, too, but the real key must"}, {"start_seconds": 617.6, "end_seconds": 621.8, "text": "match the exact object FastAPI is"}, {"start_seconds": 620.08, "end_seconds": 624.2, "text": "actually calling. When an endpoint"}, {"start_seconds": 621.8, "end_seconds": 626.12, "text": "depends on a real specific instance, the"}, {"start_seconds": 624.2, "end_seconds": 629.64, "text": "override correctly has to key off that"}, {"start_seconds": 626.12, "end_seconds": 631.44, "text": "exact instance, not the class itself."}, {"start_seconds": 629.64, "end_seconds": 633.76, "t