, "end_seconds": 686.64, "text": "Calling it again correctly now uses the"}, {"start_seconds": 683.68, "end_seconds": 689.72, "text": "real fake dependency instead."}, {"start_seconds": 686.64, "end_seconds": 691.96, "text": "Clearing the real overrides afterward."}, {"start_seconds": 689.72, "end_seconds": 693.52, "text": "Running the cell now."}, {"start_seconds": 691.96, "end_seconds": 695.12, "text": "This output shows the effect of"}, {"start_seconds": 693.52, "end_seconds": 697.32, "text": "overriding the real rate limited"}, {"start_seconds": 695.12, "end_seconds": 699.32, "text": "dependency in the fast API app. The"}, {"start_seconds": 697.32, "end_seconds": 701.48, "text": "first call returns the real limiters"}, {"start_seconds": 699.32, "end_seconds": 703.32, "text": "response, while the second call returns"}, {"start_seconds": 701.48, "end_seconds": 704.96, "text": "the fake limiters response after the"}, {"start_seconds": 703.32, "end_seconds": 706.88, "text": "override."}, {"start_seconds": 704.96, "end_seconds": 709.04, "text": "Notice how the key-value pairs in the"}, {"start_seconds": 706.88, "end_seconds": 711.24, "text": "JSON clearly indicate which limiter is"}, {"start_seconds": 709.04, "end_seconds": 713.2, "text": "active, demonstrating how dependency"}, {"start_seconds": 711.24, "end_seconds": 717.0, "text": "overriding enables controlled testing"}, {"start_seconds": 713.2, "end_seconds": 720.0, "text": "without changing production code."}, {"start_seconds": 717.0, "end_seconds": 721.28, "text": "A real class-based dependencies"}, {"start_seconds": 720.0, "end_seconds": 723.2, "text": "call"}, {"start_seconds": 721.28, "end_seconds": 725.44, "text": "genuinely supports yield exactly like a"}, {"start_seconds": 723.2, "end_seconds": 727.2, "text": "plain function does. So, a real class"}, {"start_seconds": 725.44, "end_seconds": 729.0, "text": "can hold configuration while still"}, {"start_seconds": 727.2, "end_seconds": 731.28, "text": "correctly running setup and teardown"}, {"start_seconds": 729.0, "end_seconds": 733.36, "text": "around each request."}, {"start_seconds": 731.28, "end_seconds": 734.96, "text": "Part nine, class dependencies with"}, {"start_seconds": 733.36, "end_seconds": 738.0, "text": "yield."}, {"start_seconds": 734.96, "end_seconds": 740.28, "text": "Running the cell now."}, {"start_seconds": 738.0, "end_seconds": 741.96, "text": "A real configurable managed resource"}, {"start_seconds": 740.28, "end_seconds": 744.2, "text": "class."}, {"start_seconds": 741.96, "end_seconds": 745.72, "text": "It's real constructor genuinely taking a"}, {"start_seconds": 744.2, "end_seconds": 747.52, "text": "name."}, {"start_seconds": 745.72, "end_seconds": 750.28, "text": "Storing it."}, {"start_seconds": 747.52, "end_seconds": 752.56, "text": "A real empty event log, too."}, {"start_seconds": 750.28, "end_seconds": 754.68, "text": "It's real call method."}, {"start_seconds": 752.56, "end_seconds": 756.6, "text": "Recording a real open event tagged with"}, {"start_seconds": 754.68, "end_seconds": 758.88, "text": "its own name."}, {"start_seconds": 756.6, "end_seconds": 762.24, "text": "A real try block."}, {"start_seconds": 758.88, "end_seconds": 764.68, "text": "Yielding a real small resource payload."}, {"start_seconds": 762.24, "end_seconds": 766.72, "text": "A real finally block."}, {"start_seconds": 764.68, "end_seconds": 769.4, "text": "Recording a real close event, too,"}, {"start_seconds": 766.72, "end_seconds": 772.68, "text": "genuinely tagged the same way."}, {"start_seconds": 769.4, "end_seconds": 774.92, "text": "A real specific named instance."}, {"start_seconds": 772.68, "end_seconds": 777.28, "text": "A real endpoint."}, {"start_seconds": 774.92, "end_seconds": 779.2, "text": "It's real handler genuinely depending on"}, {"start_seconds": 777.28, "end_seconds": 781.84, "text": "that instance."}, {"start_seconds": 779.2, "end_seconds": 784.04, "text": "Returning the real resource."}