ds": 825.16, "end_seconds": 829.16, "text": "class-based dependency enforcing a per"}, {"start_seconds": 827.16, "end_seconds": 831.12, "text": "endpoint limit combined with a real"}, {"start_seconds": 829.16, "end_seconds": 833.56, "text": "function-based lookup dependency, the"}, {"start_seconds": 831.12, "end_seconds": 836.84, "text": "exact kind of layered reusable design a"}, {"start_seconds": 833.56, "end_seconds": 839.48, "text": "real production API actually uses."}, {"start_seconds": 836.84, "end_seconds": 841.88, "text": "Part 10, a real pattern, a configurable"}, {"start_seconds": 839.48, "end_seconds": 844.88, "text": "rate limiter plus lookup."}, {"start_seconds": 841.88, "end_seconds": 848.12, "text": "Running the cell now."}, {"start_seconds": 844.88, "end_seconds": 851.36, "text": "A real fresh app for this real pattern."}, {"start_seconds": 848.12, "end_seconds": 853.6, "text": "A real configurable class-based limiter."}, {"start_seconds": 851.36, "end_seconds": 855.72, "text": "It's real constructor genuinely taking a"}, {"start_seconds": 853.6, "end_seconds": 857.64, "text": "configured maximum."}, {"start_seconds": 855.72, "end_seconds": 860.8, "text": "Storing it."}, {"start_seconds": 857.64, "end_seconds": 863.08, "text": "Starting a real running count to zero."}, {"start_seconds": 860.8, "end_seconds": 865.68, "text": "It's real call method."}, {"start_seconds": 863.08, "end_seconds": 867.8, "text": "Incrementing the real count."}, {"start_seconds": 865.68, "end_seconds": 869.56, "text": "If the real configured maximum genuinely"}, {"start_seconds": 867.8, "end_seconds": 872.68, "text": "wasn't known."}, {"start_seconds": 869.56, "end_seconds": 874.44, "text": "Raising a real 2 minute requests error."}, {"start_seconds": 872.68, "end_seconds": 876.0, "text": "Otherwise returning the real current"}, {"start_seconds": 874.44, "end_seconds": 878.48, "text": "usage."}, {"start_seconds": 876.0, "end_seconds": 881.2, "text": "Importing HTTP exception here, right"}, {"start_seconds": 878.48, "end_seconds": 883.8, "text": "where it's genuinely first needed."}, {"start_seconds": 881.2, "end_seconds": 885.72, "text": "A real strict instance allowing only two"}, {"start_seconds": 883.8, "end_seconds": 888.8, "text": "real calls."}, {"start_seconds": 885.72, "end_seconds": 892.08, "text": "A real tiny in-memory catalog."}, {"start_seconds": 888.8, "end_seconds": 895.28, "text": "A real function-based lookup dependency."}, {"start_seconds": 892.08, "end_seconds": 897.96, "text": "If the real ID genuinely isn't known."}, {"start_seconds": 895.28, "end_seconds": 899.76, "text": "Raising a real 404."}, {"start_seconds": 897.96, "end_seconds": 901.24, "text": "Otherwise returning the real product"}, {"start_seconds": 899.76, "end_seconds": 903.36, "text": "name."}, {"start_seconds": 901.24, "end_seconds": 905.68, "text": "A real endpoint."}, {"start_seconds": 903.36, "end_seconds": 907.0, "text": "It's real handler genuinely depending on"}, {"start_seconds": 905.68, "end_seconds": 908.56, "text": "both the lookup and the limiter"}, {"start_seconds": 907.0, "end_seconds": 910.96, "text": "together."}, {"start_seconds": 908.56, "end_seconds": 914.08, "text": "Returning both together."}, {"start_seconds": 910.96, "end_seconds": 916.56, "text": "Wrapping in a real dedicated client."}, {"start_seconds": 914.08, "end_seconds": 919.28, "text": "Calling with a real valid ID, correctly"}, {"start_seconds": 916.56, "end_seconds": 920.88, "text": "the real first allowed call."}, {"start_seconds": 919.28, "end_seconds": 923.2, "text": "Calling again with a real different"}, {"start_seconds": 920.88, "end_seconds": 925.0, "text": "valid ID, correctly the real second"}, {"start_seconds": 923.2, "end_seconds": 927.2, "text": "allowed call."}, {"start_seconds": 925.0, "end_seconds": 929.16, "text": "Calling a real third time, correctly"}, {"start_seconds": 927.2, "end_seconds": 931.32, "text": "rejected, the configured limit was"}, {"start_seconds": 929.16, "end_seconds": 933.44, "text": "genuinely reached."}, {"start_seconds": 931.32, "end_seconds": 935.44, "text": "Running the cell now."}, {"start_seconds": 933.44, "end_seconds": 937.4, "text": "This output shows how the rate limiter"}, {"start_seconds": 935.44, "end_seconds": 939.6, "text": "tracks and enforces a maximum of two"}, {"start_seconds": 937.4, "end_seconds": 941.44, "text": "calls. The first two requests return"}, {"start_seconds": 939.6, "end_seconds": 944.6, "text": "product names with incremental call"}, {"start_seconds": 941.44, "end_seconds": 947.32, "text": "counts, while the third triggers a 429"}, {"start_seconds": 944.6, "end_seconds": 948.92, "text": "error due to exceeding the limit."}, {"start_seconds": 947.32, "end_seconds": 951.0, "text": "Notice how the calls"}, {"start_seconds": 948.92, "end_seconds": 953.04, "text": "so underscore far count increases with"}, {"start_seconds": 951.0, "end_seconds": 955.12, "text": "each successful call, demonstrating the"}, {"start_seconds": 953.04, "end_seconds": 958.28, "text": "limiters stateful behavior integrated"}, {"start_seconds": 955.12, "end_seconds": 960.24, "text": "via fast API dependencies."}, {"start_seconds": 958.28, "end_seconds": 962.32, "text": "This confirms the lessons aim to build a"}, {"start_seconds": 960.24, "end_seconds": 966.4, "text": "configurable rate limiter that restricts"}, {"start_seconds": 962.32, "end_seconds": 969.52, "text": "usage while allowing valid lookups."}, {"start_seconds": 966.4, "end_seconds": 972.08, "text": "We covered a lot, so let's recap."}, {"start_seconds": 969.52, "end_seconds": 973.84, "text": "Wrap up what you learned."}, {"start_seconds": 972.08, "end_seconds": 975.72, "text": "A callable class with a call method"}, {"start_seconds": 973.84, "end_seconds": 977.92, "text": "works as a dependency, letting in it"}, {"start_seconds": 975.72, "end_seconds": 979.68, "text": "hold configuration."}, {"start_seconds": 977.92, "end_seconds": 981.36, "text": "Different instances of the same class"}, {"start_seconds": 979.68, "end_seconds": 983.24, "text": "can carry different configuration"}, {"start_seconds": 981.36, "end_seconds": 985.12, "text": "independently."}, {"start_seconds": 983.24, "end_seconds": 987.32, "text": "Depends of class lets fast API"}, {"start_seconds": 985.12, "end_seconds": 989.44, "text": "instantiate the class itself, treating"}, {"start_seconds": 987.32, "end_seconds": 991.28, "text": "in it like a handler."}, {"start_seconds": 989.44, "end_seconds": 993.12, "text": "Depends with no argument infers the"}, {"start_seconds": 991.28, "end_seconds": 994.88, "text": "class from the parameters own type"}, {"start_seconds": 993.12, "end_seconds": 996.72, "text": "annotation."}, {"start_seconds": 994.88, "end_seconds": 999.76, "text": "A bound method on an already configured"}, {"start_seconds": 996.72, "end_seconds": 1001.8, "text": "instance works as a dependency, too."}, {"start_seconds": 999.76, "end_seconds": 1003.96, "text": "A class dependency can declare its own"}, {"start_seconds": 1001.8, "end_seconds": 1005.6, "text": "depend sub dependencies, just like a"}, {"start_seconds": 1003.96, "end_seconds": 1007.6, "text": "function."}, {"start_seconds": 1005.6, "end_seconds": 1009.0, "text": "Dependency underscore overrides works"}, {"start_seconds": 1007.6, "end_seconds": 1011.76, "text": "the same way for class based"}, {"start_seconds": 1009.0, "end_seconds": 1013.56, "text": "dependencies as for functions."}, {"start_seconds": 1011.76, "end_seconds": 1015.68, "text": "A class dependencies call method"}, {"start_seconds": 1013.56, "end_seconds": 1018.04, "text": "supports yield for setup and teardown,"}, {"start_seconds": 1015.68, "end_seconds": 1019.48, "text": "scoped to the instance."}, {"start_seconds": 1018.04, "end_seconds": 1021.64, "text": "Class based and function based"}, {"start_seconds": 1019.48, "end_seconds": 1023.36, "text": "dependencies combine freely on the same"}, {"start_seconds": 1021.64, "end_seconds": 1025.16, "text": "endpoint."}, {"start_seconds": 1023.36, "end_seconds": 1027.12, "text": "That wraps up class based and sub"}, {"start_seconds": 1025.16, "end_seconds": 1031.44, "text": "dependencies."}, {"start_seconds": 1027.12, "end_seconds": 1033.32, "text": "Next up, API router, organizing routes."}, {"start_seconds": 1031.44, "end_seconds": 1036.44, "text": "See you there."}, {"start_seconds": 1033.32, "end_seconds": 1036.44, "text": "Running the cell now."}]}